<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Veller Partners LLC | Institutional Capital & Investment Solutions</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="any">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32.png">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
    <style is:inline>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a0e27 0%, #1a1f3a 100%);
            color: #e8eef7;
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        header {
            background: rgba(10, 14, 39, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            padding: 1.2rem 0;
        }
        .navbar {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.8rem;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .logo img {
            width: 42px;
            height: 42px;
        }
        .hero-logo {
            width: 150px;
            height: 150px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        nav a {
            color: #b4bcc8;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 2.5rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }
        nav a:hover {
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .hero {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 6rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            min-height: 70vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #b4bcc8 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: #a8b2c1;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a5f8f 0%, #3a4f7f 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
        .cta-button:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5a6f9f 0%, #4a5f8f 100%);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        .section {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 5rem 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }
        .section h2 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .section-content {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .section-content p {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: #b4bcc8;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        .pillars {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }
        .pillar {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .pillar:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            transform: translateY(-4px);
        }
        .pillar h3 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .pillar p {
            color: #a8b2c1;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        .contact-section {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 3rem;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 3rem auto 0;
        }
        .contact-section h3 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .contact-info {
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }
        .contact-info a {
            color: #4a5f8f;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .contact-info a:hover {
            color: #5a6f9f;
        }
        footer {
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            color: #7a8294;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .footer-content {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .footer-links {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .footer-links a {
            color: #7a8294;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 1.5rem;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .footer-links a:hover {
            color: #b4bcc8;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }
            .hero p {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
            .section h2 {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            nav a {
                margin-left: 1.5rem;
                font-size: 0.85rem;
            }
            .navbar {
                padding: 0 1rem;
            }
            .section {
                padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="navbar">
            <a href="/" class="logo"><img src="/logo.svg" alt="Veller Partners LLC logo"><span>Veller Partners LLC</span></a>
            <nav>
                <a href="#about">About</a>
                <a href="#approach">Approach</a>
                <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>
    <section class="hero">
        <img class="hero-logo" src="/logo-full.svg" alt="Veller Partners LLC cube logo">
        <h1>Institutional Capital Solutions</h1>
        <p>Strategic partnerships deploying significant capital to support transformative enterprises and emerging technologies</p>
        <a href="#contact" class="cta-button">Investor Relations</a>
    </section>
    <section class="section" id="about">
        <h2>About Veller Partners LLC</h2>
        <div class="section-content">
            <p>Veller Partners LLC is a registered investment partnership focused on direct capital deployment and strategic partnerships with high-potential ventures in transformative sectors. We leverage institutional expertise to identify, evaluate, and support companies at critical inflection points.</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 2rem; color: #7a8294; font-size: 0.95rem;">Founded 2026 | Registered Investment Partnership</p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section" id="approach">
        <h2>Investment Approach</h2>
        <div class="section-content">
            <p>Our strategy is built on deep sector expertise, rigorous due diligence, and active partnership with management teams. We provide not only capital but strategic guidance and operational support.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillars">
            <div class="pillar">
                <h3>Strategic Capital</h3>
                <p>Flexible funding structures tailored to enterprise needs and growth stages</p>
            </div>
            <div class="pillar">
                <h3>Operational Excellence</h3>
                <p>Value-add partnerships with proven management expertise and market insight</p>
            </div>
            <div class="pillar">
                <h3>Long-Term Vision</h3>
                <p>Patient capital aligned with sustainable value creation and exit opportunities</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section" id="contact">
        <h2>Investor Relations</h2>
        <div class="contact-section">
            <h3>Get in Touch</h3>
            <p style="color: #a8b2c1; margin-bottom: 2rem;">For investment opportunities, partnership inquiries, or due diligence information</p>
            <div class="contact-info">
                <p><strong>Email:</strong></p>
                <a href="mailto:iv@vellerpartners.com">iv@vellerpartners.com</a>
            </div>
            <div class="contact-info">
                <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem; color: #7a8294; font-size: 0.9rem;">
                    All inquiries are subject to confidentiality agreements and proper KYC procedures
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <footer>
        <div class="footer-content">
            <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
                <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>
                <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
            </div>
            <p>&copy; 2026 Veller Partners LLC. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
